  m_text: "This is Emotion Duel, a game where you and your opponent battle through
    emotions \u2014 whoever can control their emotions best wins!\n\nThis game is
    designed for you and your close friends or family to enjoy together. Invite them
    and challenge each other in an intense emotional showdown!\n\nHow to Play:\n\nClick
    Play \u2014 you\u2019ll be directed to log in if you already have an account,
    or register if you don\u2019t.\n\nOnce logged in, you\u2019ll see a list of online
    users. You can invite your friends (who are already on your friends list) to
    play and start your emotional duel!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53bd60210aca747438bc6dc6c1b9c600, type: 2}
