      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Smartwatch Mode is an Emotion Duel game mode that connects your smartwatch
    to the app, allowing the system to monitor your heart rate in real time.\n\nWhen
    you enter Smartwatch Mode, the app compares your heart rate with your opponent\u2019s.
    The lower your heart rate is compared to your opponent\u2019s, the higher your
    score will be.\n\nYour goal is to stay calm under pressure while trying to provoke
    your opponent\u2019s emotions \u2014 make their heart rate rise while keeping
    yours steady. The one who maintains control of their heartbeat wins the emotional
    duel!\n\n\U0001F4A1 Tip: Master your breathing and composure \u2014 sometimes,
    silence and a steady gaze can be more powerful than words."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53bd60210aca747438bc6dc6c1b9c600, type: 2}
